    {
      "id": "49ab9fd0-6d07-4142-914b-1adf26dd8854",
      "index": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1. Project background and objectives",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "230cb219-9ee2-415a-a96e-a87ee026f159",
      "index": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1.1. DCC：Document Control Center",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a99ec2b1-5e03-4292-be66-add6ec89da63",
      "index": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1.2. DCN：Document Change Notice(for Company Rules and Regulations)",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ea03a19e-7a64-4721-85d2-f9de3d4be75c",
      "index": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1.3. DMS：Document Management System",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6f43f6e3-02ae-4110-a946-286bcf65707d",
      "index": 5,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "2",
      "content": "1.4. Background description",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "75f6c380-feb1-4445-b16b-427d510a20d7",
      "index": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "With the continuous evolution of artificial intelligence technology, large language models (LLM) and multimodal models have demonstrated remarkable capabilities in comprehension, generation, and reasoning. An increasing number of enterprises are beginning to experiment with integrating AI technology into their actual business processes, aiming to enhance information processing efficiency, optimize decision-making quality, and reduce reliance on human experience. Against this backdrop。",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b37682f7-3fe2-40c9-8170-afcf509e90b7",
      "index": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1.4.1. Industry prospects",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "93a51828-bdff-49ee-9f5c-2503e3d66879",
      "index": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "A. The current industry as a whole exhibits the following characteristics：",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "913cee6e-a13e-4d05-a67d-39ba387bdb8c",
      "index": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "B. The capabilities of pre-trained models have rapidly improved, but there are still differences in scenario generalization",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9e297538-07a0-4ecd-b112-55c8c82789a1",
      "index": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "C. The scale of internal data within the enterprise continues to grow, leading to a strong demand for intelligent retrieval and analysis",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "889fa59b-dbd3-4217-a6c9-3d04edbe72d6",
      "index": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "D. AI systems are gradually evolving from single-point applications towards platformization and servitization",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b6ebf349-a6ff-4a4a-b563-67be4d141284",
      "index": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "E. Main pain points",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6861ce63-022b-4243-bcaa-8d91998d24cf",
      "index": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "F. In the actual implementation process, common issues include but are not limited to：",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "386abb11-8458-450a-b66c-0aaa33ee1a11",
      "index": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "G. The data sources are complex, with a coexistence of structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "dc223ac3-0f2a-4e1d-a191-dc403be1d64b",
      "index": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "H. The coupling between model services and business logic is too high, resulting in poor system maintainability",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "53d4515b-f08c-44b6-b906-9f6b53fec751",
      "index": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "I. Without a unified evaluation and monitoring mechanism, it is difficult to continuously ensure the effectiveness of the model",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c7672b03-4326-4a7e-b6f5-a6d4a08bfde2",
      "index": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "a. 为了能使 Reticle Stocker 讷讷够正确快速的读取光照条码，光照 MA 必须使用BarcodeReader扫描自光照厂所送出的Barcode（以有效防止人为之输入错误），之后再利用光照室旁的 Barcode Printer 打印 Reticle ID，并贴雨 Reticle POD 之上。",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bd0e485f-3442-47c5-98f3-bac40eceae57",
      "index": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "b. Barcode使用9cmX3cm标签打印，它的形式如下（图四）：",
      "page_num": 1
    },
